  "properties": {
    "title": "State of GeoNode",
    "description": "This presentation will introduce the attendees to those which are GeoNode's current capabilities and to some practical use cases of particular interest in order to also highlight the possibility of customization and integration. We will provide a summary of new features added to GeoNode in the last release together with a glimpse of what we have planned for next year and beyond, straight from the core developers.",
